%2A%20the%20crate%2C%20and%20%60options.imports%60%20maps%20an%20import%20specifier%20to%20the%20signatures%0A%20%2A%20%7B%40link%20selfTranslationSignatures%7D%20gives%20for%20that%20module%2C%20which%20bind%20the%0A%20%2A%20imported%20names%20the%20same%20way.%0A%20%2A%0A%20%2A%20Report%20tooling%20can%20opt%20into%20%60retainDiagnostics%3A%20true%60%20to%20retain%20the%20actual%0A%20%2A%20TranslationError%20kind%2C%20reason%2C%20message%2C%20span%20and%20details%20on%20carried%20items.%0A%20%2A%20The%20diagnostic%20also%20records%20the%20complete%20source%20group%27s%20UTF-8%20byte%20range%3B%0A%20%2A%20the%20original%20frontend%20span%20is%20retained%20without%20coordinate%20conversion.%0A%20%2A%20This%20does%20not%20change%20emitted%20code%20or%20ordinary%20item%20fields.%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20selfTranslate%28source%2C%20sourceLanguage%2C%20targetLanguage%2C%20options%20%3D%20%7B%7D%29%20%7B%0A%20%20return%20translateModule%28source%2C%20sourceLanguage%2C%20targetLanguage%2C%20options%29.translation%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Preserve%20the%20actual%20compiler%20diagnostic%20for%20each%20ordinary%20source%20item.%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20selfTranslateWithDiagnostics%28source%2C%20sourceLanguage%2C%20targetLanguage%2C%20options%20%3D%20%7B%7D%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20translation%20%3D%20selfTranslate%28source%2C%20sourceLanguage%2C%20targetLanguage%2C%20%7B%20...options%2C%20retainDiagnostics%3A%20true%20%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20return%20%7B%20translation%2C%20diagnostics%3A%20translation.items.map%28item%20%3D%3E%20item.diagnostic%20%3F%3F%20null%29%20%7D%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%0A%20%2A%20The%20signatures%20of%20the%20exported%20items%20of%20the%20JavaScript%20or%20TypeScript%20module%0A%20%2A%20%60source%60%20that%20translate%20into%20Rust%2C%20in%20source%20order%2C%20for%0A%20%2A%20%7B%40link%20selfTranslate%7D%27s%20%60options.imports%60%20of%20a%20module%20that%20imports%20them%3A%0A%20%2A%20%60%7B%20k%3A%20%27fn%27%2C%20name%2C%20params%3A%20%5